# The repository root is a build context only as the backend image's
# "bundle" (docker-compose.yml's additional_contexts, D-61): the files the
# release bundle carries besides those under backend/. Everything else stays
# out, so the context is a few kilobytes.
*
!docker-compose.yml
!traefik/dynamic/dynamic.yml
!install.sh
!docker-compose.git.yml
